abstract: >-
  An MCP server exposing FHIR R4B Patient, Observation, MedicationRequest,
  Condition, and Encounter resources as agent tools, plus a composite
  compute_adherence tool that routes questions between a structured FHIR
  pipeline and a narrative-resource pipeline.
